====================

Voxframe is licensed under Apache 2.0 (see LICENSE). This file records every
third-party component, its license, and why it is acceptable.

The project's core promise is that everything required runs free and locally,
and that any user may redistribute and use the result commercially. Every
entry below is therefore under a permissive or weak-copyleft license allowing
free commercial use. Components that fail that test are listed under
"Excluded" with the reason.

Last audited: 2026-09-25 (Phase 2)

Audit scope: the full transitive closure of runtime requirements (19 packages),
not only the packages declared in pyproject.toml. Enforced by
tests/unit/test_license_audit.py, which walks the dependency graph and fails on
any undocumented or non-permissive package.


